  "mail.encryption.scopeHonest": "What this actually protects: backups, copies, folders you sync to a cloud, and machines other people can log in to. It does not protect against anyone who can run programs as you while Eldrun is open, and if your whole disk is already encrypted it adds little to the stolen-laptop case.",
